  "description": "ASP.NET Core pieces for a site behind Cloudflare: an origin check with a shared secret that hides health endpoints and trusts CF-Connecting-IP only after it, security headers with a per-request CSP nonce, and shared-cache headers for public pages that stay private for signed-in visitors. No support: built for my own projects and shared as is; issues and pull requests aren't monitored, and any release may change or break things.",
